Orcs have seen countless battles, and won many of them.

You revel in the defeat of your foes, gaining [9%, 10%, 11%, 12%, 13% (TL1-5; CON 100)] damage resistance for 2 turns each time you kill an enemy.

The resistance will scale with talent level and your Constitution.

Additionally, passively increase all damage penetration by [6%, 10%, 12%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)].
